// range+violin_bo5+violin_names56_bo3+violin_names57_bo3_violin_shaped — attacks reshaped from range+violin_bo5+violin_names56_bo3+violin_names57_bo3_violin.sfz by shape_attacks.py --mode bow
// model's first stroke cut away; the sampler bows the note on (140 ms soft, 40 ms full velocity)
// zones and keycenters are the source's; tune is re-measured on each reshaped sample.

